	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"遊びの幅を広げるSDCSの「拡張パーツセット」にグレーがラインナップ！",
			"• 既存のフレームに組み付けることで高頭身と低頭身にカスタマイズ可能！",
			"• 平手（左右）、握り手（左）、サーベル持ち手（右）が付属。",
			"• 別売りのSDCSフレームに付属するジムヘッドとSDCSガンダムに本商品を組み合わせることで「ジム」が作れる！",
			"• SDCSザクIIに使えるふとももパーツが付属！！"
		],
		"en": [
			"Gray is now available in SDCS's \"extended parts set\" that expands the range of play!",
			"• Can be customized to have a high or low head by assembling it to an existing frame!",
			"• Open hands (left and right), grasping hands (left), and saber handles (right) are included.",
			"• You can create a \"gym\" by combining this product with the gym head and SDCS Gundam that come with the SDCS frame (sold separately)!",
			"• Thigh parts that can be used with SDCS Zaku II are included! !"
		]
	},
